g></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="encryption" class="section"> <div class="section__inner o-container"> <div id="encryption-main"> <div id="encryption-header"> <div id="encryption-tagline" class="sub1">Origin verification, simplified</div> <h2 id="encryption-title">Smart flip <br>verification</h2> <div id="encryption-desc" class="body2">Type a yield. Flip. Trace its origin — instantly. <br>Transparency at its most honest.</div> </div> <div id="encryption-field"> <div class="encryption-field-line"></div> <div class="encryption-field-line"></div> <div class="encryption-field-line"></div> <div class="encryption-field-line"></div> <input type="text" id="encryption-field-input" value="ORIGIN" maxlength="10"> </div> <button id="encryption-field-flip-btn" class="btn is-active is-flipper"><span id="encryption-field-flip-btn-inner"><span class="is-flipper-target">Verify Origin</span><span class="is-flipper-target">Reveal Source</span></span></button> </div> </div> </div> <div id="grip" class="section"> <div class="section__inner o-container"> <div id="grip-header"> <div id="grip-tagline" class="sub1">Zero Fillers. Pure Grain.</div> <h2 id="grip-title">Essential Oil<br>Density</h2> <div id="grip-desc" class="body2">Volatile oils so potent your kitchen files <br>a restraining order against bland. Additives? <br>Consider them permanently eliminated.</div> </div> <div id="grip-zoom-box" class="sub2 prevent-select"> <div id="grip-zoom-box__inner"> <div id="grip-zoom-box__image"></div> <div id="grip-zoom-box__content"> <div id="grip-zoom-box__content-bg"></div> <div id="grip-zoom-box__content-label">Oil concentration (est):</div> <div id="grip-zoom-box__content-coeff">High</div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="grip-instruction"> <svg id="grip-instruction-wheel" viewBox="0 0 100 15"> <path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.25" d="M50,12.125c32,0,50,-8.5,50,-10" stroke-dasharray="1 1"></path> <path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.25" d="M50,12.125c-32,0,-50,-8.5,-50,-10" stroke-dasharray="1 1"></path> <circle cx="50" cy="12.125" r="0.8" fill="currentColor"></circle> <circle id="grip-instruction-wheel-circle" cx="50" cy="12.125" r="1.8" fill="currentColor"></circle> </svg> <svg id="grip-instruction-icon"><use href="#hand-tmpl"></use></svg> </div> </div> </div> <div id="sustainability" class="section"> <div class="section__inner o-container"> <div id="sustainability-hero"> <div id="sustainability-hero-inner"> <div id="sustainability-tagline" class="sub2">100% Indigenous</div> <div id="sustainability-title"> <h4 id="sustainability-title-pre">Soil-first</h4> <h2 id="sustainability-title-main">authenticity</h2> </div> <div id="sustainability-desc" class="body2">Pure yields sourced ethically. <br>Completely indigenous — no shortcuts taken, <br>and zero synthetic interference. Ever.</div> </div> </div> <div id="sustainability-items" class="o-grid"> <div class="sustainability-item"> <h3 class="sustainability-item-title">Average <br>age of <br>soil</h3> <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">The Western Ghats are older than the Himalayas — older than most mountain ranges on earth. The soil holds memory.</div> <div class="sustainability-item-num">25M</div> </div> <div class="sustainability-item"> <h4 class="sustainability-item-title">Harvest <br>cycles</h4> <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">Each harvest follows the natural monsoon rhythm — no forcing, no accelerating. The season decides.</div> <canvas id="sustainability-rive-canvas-harvesting"></canvas> </div> <div class="sustainability-item"> <h4 class="sustainability-item-title">Pesticides <br>used</h4> <div class="sustainability-item-desc body2">Zero synthetic chemicals. No exceptions. What goes into the soil comes back to you — we take that seriously.</div> <canvas id="sustainability-rive-canvas-text"></canvas> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="testimonies" class="section"> <div class="section__inner o-container"> <div id="testimonies-her